==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈbɔːɹə/}}
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|bôrʹər}}, {{IPA|/ˈbɔːɹɚ/}}
* {{rhymes|ɔːɹə(ɹ)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person who bores, who drills.
# A tool used for [[drilling]].
# An [[insect]] or insect [[larva]] that bores into wood.
# One of the many types of [[mollusc]] that bore into soft rock.
# The [[hagfish]] (''[[Myxine]]'').

{{Webster 1913}}

